\f0\b\fs56 \cf0 Introduction
\b0\fs24 \
\
Old versions of Mac OS X have trouble talking to the modern internet. AquaTransport can help.\
\
AquaTransport modifies how apps on your Mac talk to servers on the internet. It won't fix everything, but it will fix a lot of little things. For example, AquaTransport can fix problems with:\
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\'95	}Viewing web pages in Safari.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Connecting to email providers in Mail.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Subscribing to calendars in the Calendar/iCal.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Loading Help Center pages in various apps.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Reading Wikipedia in the Dictionary app. (OS X 10.7+)\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural
\cf0 \
AquaTranport is compatible with Mac OS X 10.6 Snow Leopard \'96 Mac OS X 10.9 Mavericks.\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural

