\b\fs56 \cf0 \
For Advanced Users
\fs48 \

\fs40 \
URL Redirects\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural

\b0\fs24 \cf0 \
The file 
\b /usr/share/aquatransport/redirects.txt
\b0  contains sets of URL redirect rules separated by blank lines.\
\
The first line controls which app or apps (technically executable names) the rule applies to. Multiple apps should be separated by commas. Use * for every app.\
\
The second line contains the original URL to match. This is a "starts with" match.\
\
The third line contains the new URL.\
\
For example:\
\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\fi720\pardirnatural
\cf0 \
Audion\
http://freedb.freedb.org/\
https:/gnudb.gnudb.org/\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural
\cf0 \
This tells AquaTransport "send any Audion traffic originally addressed addressed to 
\b http://freedb.freedb.org/
\b0  to 
\b gnudb.gnudb.org
\b0  instead."\
\
To create your own redirects, add additional sets of URLs to this file. Changes take effect immediately.\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural

\b\fs40 \cf0 \
Custom Headers
\b0\fs24 \
\
The file 
\b /usr/share/aquatransport/headers.txt
\b0  makes it possible to set custom headers on traffic an app addresses to a URL.\
\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural
\cf0 The first line controls which app or apps (technically executable names) the rule applies to. Multiple apps should be separated by commas. Use * for every app.\
\
The second line contains a URL. This is a "starts with" match.\
\
Every subsequent line contains a custom header to apply to your URL. To unset an existing header, don't put anything after the colon.\
\
For example:\
\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\fi720\pardirnatural
\cf0 SoundJam\
http://dogcow.com/moof.php\
X-API-Key: abcdefgh1234567\
User-Agent: OmniWeb/3.0.2\
Accept-Encoding:\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural

